  {
   "steps": [
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Danny."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_7cfdad18d4"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "If you're hearing this, you found the vault. Which means you're grown, and you came back. Which means I failed at the one thing I asked of anyone. I asked them never to let you come back."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_234783e7d9"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "So I'll assume you're as stubborn as I am, and I'll say what I need to say."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_8a399ed91e"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "I'm sorry. I brought you down here because you slept. That's the truth. It's a small, selfish truth, and it's the worst thing I ever did."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_1ffb9200d6"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "It wants you because you were the first one who ever heard it without being afraid. You laughed at it. Nobody had ever laughed at it."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_4beba87fce"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "There's a key with this tape. It collapses the Aperture. Everything in the line goes silent — it, and everything that's left of us. If you turn it, we're gone. All of us. Mira too. That's all right. That's allowed."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_f0e703c3b1"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "But if you're braver than I was — if you've gathered our real voices, if you know who to trust — there is a third way. Don't open the door. Don't just close it. Answer it. Send us back down the line, all of us together. And don't do it alone."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_f83eda923f"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "It can't wear a choir. It can only wear the lonely."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_750e1c40d5"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Little light. Signal and answer. I love you. I've always loved you. Go home."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_95f73b9098"
    }
   ]
  },
