     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "Hale. Two-fifty, seventeenth of October. This is my last report, so I'll make it a good one."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_7111b2ba7f"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "At two forty-nine I sealed the containment bulkhead with twenty-three people behind it. Mira Solace looked at me through the glass while I did it. I want that on the record. I want somebody to know I saw her face."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_784cd1d453"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "It didn't matter. It isn't behind the bulkhead. It's in the line. It's in every set in this mountain. I sealed twenty-three people in for nothing."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_859f0af29f"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "So here's my last order. It's for whoever finds this, whenever that is."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_418478e021"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "If you hear me on the radio after tonight — it isn't me. I'm dead. I'm dead at two fifty-one, and I've made my peace with it."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_d1ebbd38d5"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "Whatever I tell you on that channel, do the opposite. If I tell you to open a door, you leave it shut. If I tell you to switch something on, you cut the cable."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_d7eb4dd861"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "HALE (TAPE)",
      "Kate, if this ever finds you: I kept my word as long as I could."
     ],
     "vo": "hale_8c9576e361"
    },
